# rclone filter for Vault ⇄ Dropbox:Apps/remotely-save/jdak-stack
# First match wins. Excluded trees first so they beat the allowlist below.
# Trimmed 2026-10-13: Dropbox account is 2 GB — keep the mirror note-sized; drop heavy asset/media trees.

# --- never sync: git internals, caches, databases, big asset/media trees ---
- .git/**
- **/.git/**
- **/.cache/**
- **/__pycache__/**
- **/*.duckdb
- **/assets/**
- **/masthead*/**
- **/refs/**
- 09 - FLEETING/09.01 - raw/session-turns/**
- 09 - FLEETING/09.01 - raw/content/**
- 10 - ARCHIVE/**

# --- allowlist: notes, small images, csv (no PDFs — too heavy for the 2 GB mirror) ---
+ .gitkeep
+ *.md
+ *.txt
+ *.html
+ *.png
+ *.jpg
+ *.jpeg
+ *.webp
+ *.gif
+ *.svg
+ *.csv

# --- drop everything else (pdf/py/json/logs/media/etc.) ---
- **
